cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "LearneCN: a free Mandarin study site"
message: "If you use LearneCN or its question bank in teaching or research, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - alias: clmpnn
    website: "https://github.com/clmpnn"
repository-code: "https://github.com/clmpnn/LearneCN"
url: "https://clmpnn.github.io/LearneCN/"
abstract: >-
  A static, dependency-free Mandarin study site: hanzi stroke-order practice,
  HSK 1-6 quizzes across vocabulary, characters, grammar, reading and listening,
  pinyin and zhuyin reference charts, and a built-in Chinese-English dictionary
  of 121,100 entries. Includes a question bank of 344,461 items written entirely
  in Chinese.
keywords:
  - mandarin
  - chinese
  - hanzi
  - hsk
  - pinyin
  - zhuyin
  - stroke-order
  - language-learning
  - spaced-repetition
  - cc-cedict
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
